          "settings": {
            "quote": "I've tried many oils before, but this one doesn't feel overly greasy. My scalp feels nourished after every use.",
            "name": "Sana",
            "location": "Islamabad"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Within a few weeks my hair became much easier to manage and looked healthier. Highly recommended.",
            "name": "Hira",
            "location": "Rawalpindi"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I love that it's made with natural ingredients. My hair feels stronger and has a beautiful shine.",
